<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Estee Lauder said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Estee Lauder said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs added Estee Lauder Cos Inc to the firm's priority list, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- One source said Estee Lauder was previously on the firm's recommended list.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3-1/4 to 51-3/8.</p>
</text>
